Type: project
Package: ts
Title: TS Ubike Rental Program Project
Version: 0.0.1
Description: The package list for renv. renv is in "explicit" snapshot
    mode, so renv.lock tracks exactly the packages listed here. Everything is
    under Imports on purpose: renv treats Suggests as dev-only and leaves them
    out of the lockfile. Every package here must install as a binary on
    Windows and macOS, so the group's `renv::restore()` in RStudio never has
    to compile anything. rmarkdown is for `just render`; desc is for
    `just add` and `just doctor`. VS Code and nvim tooling (languageserver,
    vscDebugger, jgd) is installed by `just setup` instead and stays out of
    the lockfile. Add packages with `just add <pkg>` (or, in RStudio,
    `renv::install("<pkg>")`, then list it here and run `renv::snapshot()`).
Depends:
    R (>= 4.6)
Imports:
    readxl,
    tidyverse,
    scales,
    testthat,
    rmarkdown,
    desc
Config/testthat/edition: 3
